<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6944] Fail to execute task with immutable list string</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6944</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Exception occurs when executing task with immutable list of string due to not able to find method readResolve/writeReplace for binary object.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It appears this is caused by a side effect of Jira &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6485&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6485&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</description>
